		"title": "Code, constants, data and bss in one object",
		"kind": "object",
		"command": "ld -o prog all.o",
		"request": "all.o: .text (ALLOC|EXECINSTR), .rodata (ALLOC), .data (ALLOC|WRITE) holding the little-endian word 17, and a 64-byte .bss (ALLOC|WRITE, SHT_NOBITS)",
